From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:09:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: Add the 2D graphics accelerator

The A733 has a 2D graphics accelerator, the G2D, in the display engine
system beside the display engine. Add its node, disabled.

The window is the 256 KiB the manual maps (chapter 2), the interrupt is
CPUX source 83, GIC SPI 51 (manual section 12.2.3.1), and the master is
master 4 of the second IOMMU (manual chapter 10). The node holds the
DE_SYS power domain like the display engine, and the AHB clock enable
of the display engine system, which clk_disable_unused() otherwise
closes when no display engine driver holds it. The reset of DE_SYS
itself is not taken: it is de-asserted by default (manual section
4.1.6.113).

It stays disabled until a driver binds it: an enabled node that no
driver binds keeps the PCK-600 from ever calling its sync_state(),
since fw_devlink waits for the consumer, so no power domain that nobody
holds would be switched off.

Not covered: the parent and rate of the module clock, and a driver:
mainline has none for an Allwinner G2D.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: with the node enabled for a test, the bus,
module and AHB clocks and the reset of the block follow runtime PM, the
DE_SYS power domain is on while it is resumed, and the version register
of the block reads back without any gate set by hand.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index 8ee1ba658c5e..6e0be8f71103 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -1406,6 +1406,19 @@ mixer0_out_de_top: endpoint {
 			};
 		};
 
+		g2d: graphics@5440000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-g2d";
+			reg = <0x05440000 0x40000>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 51 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_G2D>, <&ccu CLK_G2D>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_MBUS_DESYS>, <&ccu CLK_AHB_DE>;
+			clock-names = "bus", "mod", "mbus", "ahb";
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_G2D>;
+			power-domains = <&pck600 PD_DE_SYS>;
+			iommus = <&iommu1 4>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 		vo1_ccu: clock-controller@5510000 {
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-vo1-ccu";
 			reg = <0x05510000 0x1000>;
